{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【C108】《勝利女神：妮姬》攤位報導！夏日祭典風格佈置登場 Cosplay 攝影會盛況空前</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f615990a86c4f48a453d66bc89ee79eec673ddaed7e1cdbc6966a03c806b5ed/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe221e79368bc8eaceb202befae9862fc.jpg\"/><p>2026年8月15日（六）、16日（日）正在日本舉辦的同人誌即賣會「 Comic Market 108 」。 這次要為大家帶來「 勝利女神：妮姬 （以下簡稱：NIKKE）」攤位的現場報導！</p><h3>Cosplay、周邊販售一樣都不少，總是熱鬧非凡的 NIKKE 攤位！</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4cad23323537eb8a921d4d6596dfdf1738860c99169abc4b7c39a45cd64f4c59/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F966bedd40f423dc7a92fdd1c63e8e724.jpg\"/><p>在東京 Big Sight 南4展廳2621號攤位展出的 NIKKE( @NIKKE_japan )攤位。</p><p>祭典風格佈置</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a04711f0d2a78b242e40aae86707025a94603f1110045893fb72ce3a1e2d02e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7f2c90d36c15f29774a1e458c1b18b97.jpg\"/><p>發放購物袋</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7dedabacee26547b1ee8480a3bf3bf351154e57f4e0628a2d2ebf530762b87a8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F166394e98d7f0835fadf4c36e67fb5d4.jpg\"/><p>來 Comic Market 當然少不了購物袋。</p><p>巨大不倒翁落下遊戲</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/14f70de5abcb196494c11620fe319e65357c0ddcfa1d81188a3fcdd94b00b9da/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F848ae66858449605920b2da3664d4f68.jpg\"/><p>任何人都可以免費參加的巨大不倒翁落下遊戲！</p><p>灰姑娘來挑戰！？</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0612cf863ad37959348fbc5512781a6be3ea1659f5d6e587991854948538eef5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbd4890bbf37e61760bbb37a45d57d60c.jpg\"/><p>參加就能獲得限定周邊的壓克力相框或徽章，趁還沒送完之前趕快來參加吧！</p><p>排隊是必然的周邊販售</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/692ad0bd517a9fe370cd3ccdcf1dbb03670a9e8a38ba795c5f689ef3150a5c2f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F741b53ebded7583c7e147c9f587c7a83.jpg\"/><p>主打內容的周邊販售區！ 今天就什麼都別管，盡情買買買吧——！</p><h3>當然也有 Cosplayer 登場</h3><p>由6位 Cosplayer 輪番登場</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9febc5aaa16d8c63e9cc68c61503bbb52085da25f34cdae69ca20a486598cc23/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb976fca7100d48f84d3e6378ac293d3d.jpg\"/><p>NIKKE 每年的官方 Cosplayer 水準都非常出色。</p><p>灰姑娘 / Yasal</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/edab9576b5c1e272ec9a1893c2e02ef2ca19a09e5d3633b7f194764f0e581e14/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Faeef5e9b29ea28c70bdcb1d247dc87cd.jpg\"/><p>X: @Yasal_170</p><p>Instagram: @yasal_170</p><p>尼恩 / w百合歐皇子w</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/53e19fdd9182af3c9df9f08918744a42eafb6e9251304a498eb9ca7e37053272/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffde0d4d3e569c782a5e3368b1f766edb.jpg\"/><p>X: @Lilium725</p><p>Instagram: @oqnptluq</p><p>拉毗 / 切切Kiriko</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d11c76872c520753ea4d206a3c432ee96d10b2f311091eb5fdbbea92ee412bea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff0af8c102f1dc6db1c3549c4729b65b1.jpg\"/><p>X: @kiriko_celia</p><p>Instagram: @kiriko_celia</p><p>阿妮斯 / Sithle</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dee30736217b01d2dd2fc9dde34582dd362034fc8818c33dd40ec089e9e40e45/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa1650ba248d4803b0d5f2d64d7603bf7.jpg\"/><p>X: @Sithle011</p><p>Instagram: @sithle011</p><p>🔸【C108】TERBIS展位Cosplay照片報導！韓國演出陣營也相當出色 🔸【C108】《棕色塵埃2》攤位報導！一如既往的高品質 Cosplay 讓粉絲熱血沸騰 🔸【C108】《嘟嘟臉惡作劇》攤位報導！斯皮奇在Comic Market大量出沒 混亂場面讓路人紛紛停下腳步 🔸台灣・高雄首次舉辦日本最大級Cosplay活動「acosta!」！兩天內有1萬5千名Cosplayer與攝影師到場 🔸「ユリコタイガー（Yuriko Tiger）」宣布離開所屬事務所 METEORA st. 未來將以自由身份持續活動</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T04:18:10.461589+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":912,"images":12,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}